crimlab (0.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Every package is described by the title of the R package and says how
    to cite it.
  * New: plotsvg (the plots as SVG), plotcoh, rvwtim, entcmp, dmvar; the
    argument that names a method is mthd.
  * Fixed: a missing value stays missing on riscv64; 32-bit x86 is built
    with the arithmetic of SSE2, as every other platform computes.

